<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This is a common issue faced by the freshmen, especially those who have never been away from home or family before. For the first few days, or maybe weeks, the feeling of missing home can be a bit overwhelming. You need to reassure yourself that it is normal to feel this way, and you will be able to cope with it better as time goes by. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
