729 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Studying at the university level is not the same as high school. Realistically, the things you study will get a bit more difficult as you move one step ahead. Besides, your academic performance is not graded the same way as how it was back then in high school. These can be too much to grasp in the beginning, but you will be able to manage it with the right study plan!)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
