733 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Entering campus life will give you the opportunity to meet new people. Though some people look forward to making new connections, this can also be nerve-wracking to some. Instead of putting expectations, judgements, and assumptions, try to free your mind and let yourself experience the new social environment as it is. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
734 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (NOTE: Remember, these are just temporary issues. Once you are able to adapt and accommodate, you will enjoy the rest of your campus life! However, if you still find it difficult to cope with the stress of adjusting, you may need more support, talk to us!)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
