/ActualText (In any interaction, it is almost impossible to exclude either verbal or nonverbal communication. These two complement each other during an interaction. Pay attention to your body language when you are talking. Try to keep an open body posture to give the impression that you are approachable. Maintain good eye contact throughout the conversation, and ensure that you are keeping a reasonable personal space with the person you are interacting with.)
