/ActualText (Being able to ask good questions can keep the conversation going. This will also allow you to get to know more about the person you are talking to, or the topic that you are discussing about. If you want to gain more information, use open-ended questions instead of closed-ended. You need to make sure to stay on topic and ask relevant questions only. Be sensitive to certain topics, sometimes asking questions may not be a good move, such as asking about personal issues to an acquaintance.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [4]
