1160 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Breathing is the most basic thing that everyone does, but is not fully aware of. When you are stressed, your thinking may be cloudy and you may not also be breathing properly. This can affect the exchange of oxygen and carbon dioxide in your body, which leads to a number of physical symptoms, such as elevated stress and anxiety. )
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [3]
>>
