1174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This is a great technique to relieve stress, which can be used at any time. You need to focus on slowly tensing your muscles for a few seconds, then gradually relaxing the muscles. With practice, you will be able to know the difference between muscle tension and relaxation, and it also helps to make you more aware of your physical sensations.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [1]
>>
