1193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Having people who can support you during stressful times can really make a difference. With a good support system, you will feel more confident and secure to go through the heavy road ahead. However, it is good to expand your social connection and relationship with others so that you can avoid putting a heavy reliance on the same people. You can look for opportunities to build new connections by joining student clubs, or programs organized by the university.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Students who do not get enough rest or sleep will tend to stress more. When you are tired, it is hard for your body and mind to function well. Make sure that you include enough rest and sleep time in your daily schedule. Power naps can also help to recharge your energy in the daytime.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1195 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Ensure enough rest time)
/E (Ensure enough rest time)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [4]
>>
