<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Practice healthy lifestyle)
/E (Practice healthy lifestyle)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1199 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A healthy mind comes from a healthy body. This means that whatever you do to your body can affect your mental health. Therefore, you need to pay attention to your lifestyle, which includes your diet and physical activities. Eating healthy food and exercise regularly can help to combat stress.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (NOTE: If you find it too difficult to cope with your stress, perhaps it is best to seek professional help. You can book a counselling session and talk it out with your counsellor.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
